A total of fourteen patients received immunomodulatory therapy,
and the median time from the disease onset to the beginning of treat-
ment was 6.5 months (range, 0.3–82). As the 1st line immunotherapy,
all patients were treated with intravenous immunoglobulin (IVIG,
